      "message": "+brianosman and +johnstiles. It looks to me like the failures are actually in matrix equality and to-vector tests.\n\nFWIW we actually do use matrix inversion in an internal shader:\nhttps://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/skia/src/gpu/ops/GrDrawAtlasPathOp.cpp;l\u003d87?q\u003dGrDrawAtlasPathOp.cpp\u0026ss\u003dchromium",
