      "writtenOn": "2021-07-26T15:45:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If those tests were passing before the Dawn roll, then there\u0027s a chance that they\u0027ve uncovered a real regression in Dawn. Those tests aren\u0027t new. We have had issues with them in the past on Adreno, but AFAIK never on Quadro.",
